📘 Programs Included
This portfolio contains the following Python programs developed for CIT‑144:

Input Final Analyst Program – Processes user input and generates a final analysis summary.

Shapes Program – Creates shapes using loops and conditional logic.

Tank AI Program – Simulates tank behavior using decision structures.

Cube Calculator Program – Calculates cube values with input validation and looping.

Tank GUI (Color Change Version) – GUI version of the tank program with color‑change functionality.

Tank GUI (Letter‑Based Version) – GUI version using letters instead of numbers for controls.

Personal Expense Logger – Records expenses and calculates running totals.

Improved Admissions Program – Enhanced admissions decision program with clearer prompts and logic.

Grid Processor Program – Generates a formatted grid using nested loops.
